### Candidate Service: sample requests
### Works with the IntelliJ HTTP Client and the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Start the stack first: docker compose up --build   (dev profile loads 30 sample candidates)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@apiKey = local-dev-api-key-change-me
# A seeded candidate (Priya Sharma, status INTERVIEWING, version 2)
@seededId = 01940000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Create a candidate -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/candidates
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Asha",
  "lastName": "Kumar",
  "email": "asha.kumar@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98450 12345",
  "currentTitle": "Backend Engineer",
  "currentCompany": "Acme Corp",
  "city": "Bengaluru",
  "country": "IN",
  "yearsOfExperience": 5,
  "noticePeriodDays": 30,
  "skills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "PostgreSQL"]
}

### View a candidate
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates/{{seededId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Search: free text (every term must match), newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates?q=backend engineer
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Filter on several criteria: Java AND Spring Boot, 4-10 years, India, open pipeline stages, sorted by experience
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates?skills=java&skills=spring boot&minExperience=4&maxExperience=10&country=IN&status=NEW&status=SCREENING&status=INTERVIEWING&sort=yearsOfExperience,desc&page=0&size=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Any of several skills, short notice period, created this year
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates?skills=kotlin&skills=swift&skillsMatch=ANY&maxNoticePeriodDays=30&createdFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Update the profile (send the version from your last read; status is not part of the profile)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/candidates/{{seededId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Priya",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "email": "priya.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "currentTitle": "Staff Backend Engineer",
  "currentCompany": "Acme Corp",
  "city": "Pune",
  "country": "IN",
  "yearsOfExperience": 7,
  "noticePeriodDays": 60,
  "skills": ["java", "spring boot", "postgresql", "kafka", "kubernetes"],
  "version": 2
}

### Move through the pipeline (INTERVIEWING -> OFFERED); use the version returned by the previous call
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/candidates/{{seededId}}/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "OFFERED", "version": 3, "note": "Strong system design round" }

### Status history, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates/{{seededId}}/status-history
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/candidates/01940000-0000-7000-8000-000000000030
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ---------------- Error contract examples ----------------

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED: no API key
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates

### 400 VALIDATION_FAILED: every invalid field is listed
POST {{baseUrl}}/candidates
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "email": "not-an-email", "country": "XX", "yearsOfExperience": 99 }

### 400 VALIDATION_FAILED: page size is rejected, not silently clamped
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates?size=500
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION: response lists the allowed moves
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/candidates/01940000-0000-7000-8000-000000000003/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "HIRED", "version": 0 }

### 404 CANDIDATE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates/01940000-0000-7000-8000-999999999999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
